{"id":23700,"shortDescription":"Puzzle Kingdoms te desafía a planear ataques estratégicos para derrotar a tus enemigos. Da órdenes a tus tropas por el mapa, conquistando ciudades por medio de una innovadora mecánica de puzles. Crea y administra ejércitos liderados por comandantes heroicos para salvar el mundo de Etheria del borde de la destrucción.","developers":["Infinite Interactive"],"publishers":["Strategy First"],"categories":["Multijugador","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"27 ABR 2009","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/23700?t=1759953477","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008260.600x338.jpg?t=1759953477","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008260.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759953477"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008261.600x338.jpg?t=1759953477","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008261.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759953477"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008262.600x338.jpg?t=1759953477","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008262.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759953477"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008263.600x338.jpg?t=1759953477","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008263.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759953477"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008264.600x338.jpg?t=1759953477","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008264.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759953477"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23700/0000008265.600x338.jpg?t=1759953477","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic